This PR implements a mechanism to prevent certain species from being collected into phases when using automatic species collection for phase creation. For example, the code below could result in many aqueous species in the `AqueousPhase`:

~~~c++
Phases phases(db);
phases.add( AqueousPhase(speciate("H O Na Cl C")) );
phases.add( GaseousPhase("H2O(g) CO2(g)") );
phases.add( MineralPhases() ); 
~~~

With this PR, we'll be able to filter out some species using excluding tags. The modified code below will prevent species with *organic* tag from being added into the aqueous phase.

~~~c++
Phases phases(db);
phases.add( AqueousPhase(speciate("H O Na Cl C"), exclude("organic")) );
phases.add( GaseousPhase("H2O(g) CO2(g)") );
phases.add( MineralPhases() ); 
~~~

